WEBVTT

00:03:29.849 --> 00:03:32.200
Go out to any site,
shop up, put it in your cart.

00:03:32.224 --> 00:03:34.200
Just don't hit buy.

00:03:34.224 --> 00:03:37.617
Wait 24 hours, go back and ask yourself,

00:03:37.641 --> 00:03:38.909
"Do I really need it?

00:03:38.933 --> 00:03:41.409
What about these items map to my goal?"

00:03:41.433 --> 00:03:44.659
And if it's nothing,
hit delete and you got your fix.

00:03:44.683 --> 00:03:48.159
[6: Be good to yourself.]

00:03:48.183 --> 00:03:50.242
It's also important to know

00:03:50.266 --> 00:03:53.825
that your self-worth
is not determined by your net worth.

00:03:53.849 --> 00:03:56.034
This is something
that we can do better about.

00:03:56.058 --> 00:03:58.034
You celebrate your wins.

00:03:58.058 --> 00:04:01.659
And when you make that misstep,
no judgment, no shame.